{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"skeleton_bomber","model_identifier":"skeleton_bomber","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# skeleton_bomber\n\nSkeleton bomber (C1), breaker, 1.75 m = 62 u.\n\nMade more ominous in Patch 5: darker, cracked, aged bones; a dark tattered hood over a black spiked half-helm that leaves the face in shadow; glowing red eyes; and a bigger black iron-banded bomb keg with studs and a dull red skull on its face, with a lit fuse. `slot_fuse` marks the fuse tip for the sparks.\n\nA skeleton in a rusty kettle helmet hugging a round, iron-banded powder keg (65 cm = 23 u tall) strapped across its chest, with a short fuse and `fx_fuse` at the tip. Orange eye lights. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw` and a `keg` bone (child of torso) so the keg can come loose.\n\n- Cubes: 60, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.2..9.2, y 0.0..64.2, z -17.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 62 x 18 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `detonate` | 1.3 | hold | key 1.3 s (end of clip, holds): the blast. A last stagger forward hugging the keg; the game removes the unit and spawns the explosion at fx_fuse / the keg |\n| `aggro` | 1.3 | once | hefts the keg, jaw rattles |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing in sunlight, keg still clutched (loop) |\n| `drop_bomb` | 2 | hold | its death: struck, the keg drops (lands 0.45 s), bounces and rolls forward and settles lying on its side at (0, 6.5, -34.4) (1.8 s) while the skeleton collapses; holds. Swap in `bomb_keg` there if the game wants a separate loose keg |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | identical copy of drop_bomb |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 32.0 u per cycle\n- `run`: 96.0 u/s (2.70 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 63.4 u per cycle (bent forward under the weight)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `detonate`: key 1.3 s (end of clip, holds): the blast. A last stagger forward hugging the keg; the game removes the unit and spawns the explosion at fx_fuse / the keg\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 62, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 43.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 47.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 53, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 41, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 32, 1.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 32, 1.5)\n- `fx_fuse` on `keg` at (2.5, 58.5, -11.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Breaker: its wall attack is `detonate` (played against the wall).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- The keg is the same geometry as `bomb_keg`.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_head` at (0, 62, 0)\n- `slot_back` at (0, 43.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` at (2, 47.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` at (3.5, 53, 0)\n- `slot_carry` at (0, 41, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` at (8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` at (-10.5, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` at (-8, 29, 0)\n- `fx_fuse` at (6.4, 57.7, -13)\n- `slot_fuse` at (6.4, 57.7, -13)\n- `slot_hip_r` at (5, 32, 1.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` at (-5, 32, 1.5)"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"bone_neck#8f8468","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1,51.5,-1],"to":[1,54,1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,51.5,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[9,82,11,85],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[11,82,13,85],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[13,82,15,85],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[15,82,17,85],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[68,89,70,91],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[70,89,72,91],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"047addc6-e9a2-5167-b694-cc5c3f318349"},{"name":"bone_arm_upper_r#8f8468","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[7,40,-1],"to":[9,51,1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[8,49.5,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[81,52,83,63],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[83,52,85,63],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[85,52,87,63],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[87,52,89,63],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[72,89,74,91],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[74,89,76,91],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"482546d3-30c6-52d6-9dbc-d00704c3bfd4"},{"name":"bone_arm_lower_r#8f8468","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[7,31,-1],"to":[9,40,1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[8,40,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[114,52,116,61],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[116,52,118,61],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[118,52,120,61],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[120,52,122,61],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[76,89,78,91],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[78,89,80,91],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ad860f49-ac74-5a3d-84d4-b00d0c292ef2"},{"name":"bone_hand_r#8f8468","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[6.75,27,-1.25],"to":[9.25,31,1.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[8,31,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[112,73,115,77],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[115,73,118,77],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[118,73,121,77],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[121,73,124,77],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[101,78,104,81],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[104,78,107,81],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9c1b34e8-1937-5333-8ae2-b330b01d0c4a"},{"name":"bone_leg_upp